<title>NEW ZEALAND: SOCCER-NEW ZEALAND  BEAT FIJI 5-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEW ZEALAND  BEAT FIJI 5-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat Fiji 5-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup Oceania zone group two second</p>
<p>round soccer qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New Zealand - Wynton Rufer 18, 78; Vaughan Coveny 66, Nik</p>
<p>Viljoen 84, Riki van Steeden 89.</p>
<p>    Standings	    P   W   D   L   F   A   PTS</p>
<p> New Zealand	     4   3   0   1  13   1    9</p>
<p> Fiji			3   1   0   2   3   7    3</p>
<p> Papua New Guinea	3   1   0   2   2  10    3</p>
<p>Final group match: June 21 - Papua New Guinea v Fiji</p>
<p>Note:  New Zealand have qualified for the third round where</p>
<p>they will meet Australia in a two-leg play-off in June and July.</p>
</text>
